;\">\n          园\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          位于洛哈省的奥梅多镇，成立于\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2017年，现在由父子三人经营打理，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          与Noria类似的管理方式，富饶聘请了当地有咖啡经验传承几代的咖农来从育种、田间管理到加工处理管控，富饶庄园也种植相同的瑰夏品种、Wushwush和SL28，我有点怀疑剧本都是一伙人写的哈哈～，这只豆子也具备厄瓜多尔“甜”的特征，同时喝起来水果的感觉像咬了口苹果和那种酸甜很可口的橙子橘子的感觉。\n         </span>\n<span style='background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SHZLbYlQS1nLtCjecjqTelficyIbrMdZd1x8Yib67yeVGZuMDTKicJgqKickTfkIOcveVFnOj4MbRCGg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SHZLbYlQS1nLtCjecjqTel55lwoQzFFjzwBqcYotbhsdibYuAPXyYZ1X7d0LPjwZy1jWNVC9kWXAA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          希望大家喜欢！我是猴喜欢滴！\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          更多豆豆，关注淘宝与有赞小程序哈~\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 500px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
